Gridded crop stage and crop cycle products from Sentinel-2 + Landsat NDVI
Copyright 2026 Meijian Yang, Columbia University & NASA GISS

This package uses and adapts software from NASA Harvest / Agmatix:

  Crop Stage Detection
    https://github.com/nasaharvest/crop-stage-detection (commit 2005f53)
    Copyright 2026 Ran Pelta, Agmatix / GrowersTech
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
    fast_stage.py is a modified re-implementation of src/crop_stage.py: the
    preprocessing and stage rules were re-written as numba-compiled functions
    with default parameters. The algorithm and thresholds are unchanged;
    validate_fast_stage.py checks that both give identical stages.
    gee_ndvi.py follows the NDVI recipe of src/gee_fetch.py (Cloud Score+ and
    QA_PIXEL masking) but is a separate gridded implementation.

  Crop Cycle Detection
    https://github.com/nasaharvest/crop-cycle-detection (commit 293f906)
    Copyright 2026 Ran Pelta, Agmatix / GrowersTech
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
    fast_cycle.py is a modified re-implementation of src/crop_cycle.py and
    src/ndvi_preprocessing.py: crop_cycle_model with its default parameters was
    re-written as numba-compiled functions. The algorithm and thresholds are
    unchanged; validate_fast_cycle.py checks that both give identical results.
    The original is imported from a separate clone (not redistributed here)
    for --cycle-impl original and validation.

